From b27d31e4149b03f0da8eba3d6752c95f1f80b938 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zhen XIN <lone.zen6@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 20:03:58 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 01/14] mips: ingenic: add extended XBurst SoC support

Port the custom X1000 and X2000 architecture, cache, SMP, clock, interrupt, timer, DMA, pinctrl, remoteproc and power-management support to Linux 6.6.151. Reuse the upstream 6.6 X1000 I2S PLL implementation and retain the additional MAC PHY, CIM and DMIC clocks.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
